*
* The following has been commented out since it is not relevant to the
* Electra SFC controller.
*
*DiskType set G28
DPort set $E014

Drive set 0 start assembly with drive #0
DriveCnt set 8 drives max on system
Densy set 1 MFM or FM
Sides set 2 single or double
StpRat set 0 slowest
IntrLeav set 3
DrvSiz set 535
Density set Densy+0 single track density
